==Battleground==
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
**2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Doing this stage as your fifth stage to unlock Courier Cat's Egg is not advised considering how much harder this is compared to [[Woodlands Area 4]] or [[Badlands Area 2]].

Once you get [[Courier Cat]], this stage should become very easy. The Zombie enemies can pose some threat from their burrowing, so use high damage units like [[Can Can Cat]] or Z-Killers like [[Polevaulter Cat]].

